    The launcher icon's colours, taken from the keyboard's own default theme rather than
    chosen separately: the background is KeyboardTheme.backgroundColor, the key faces are
    textColor, and the space bar is accentColor. An icon that does not match the thing it
    launches is a small lie, and these three values are the ones a user actually sees.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">#FF14141A</color>
    <color name="ic_launcher_key">#FFF2F2F7</color>
    <color name="ic_launcher_accent">#FF6EA8FE</color>
</resources>
